<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Data General upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Data General upgraded.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley upgraded Data General Corp to outperform from neutral, a market source said.</p>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley also raised the fiscal 1997 earnings estimates to $1.30 from $1.25 and increased the fiscal 1998 estimates to $1.60 from $1.50, the market source said.</p>
<p>-- the market source also said Data General &quot;has an analyst meeting next Tuesday to introduce major new products.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
</text>
